1
00:00:00,254 --> 00:00:01,584
(Howard:)Okay, calm down.

2
00:00:01,589 --> 00:00:03,089
(Howard:)There's probably something
jammed behind it.

3
00:00:03,090 --> 00:00:04,960
(Howard:)Just, uh, pull it out
and see what's there.

4
00:00:04,959 --> 00:00:06,029
(Raj:)Hang on.

5
00:00:10,130 --> 00:00:12,770
(Raj:)Oh... no. Oh, no.

6
00:00:12,767 --> 00:00:14,167
Oh, God, no!

7
00:00:15,769 --> 00:00:17,839
(Howard:)You know what, you sound busy--
I'm gonna let you go.

8
00:00:19,105 --> 00:00:21,105
(Raj:)Dude, the whole front came off.

9
00:00:21,108 --> 00:00:22,738
(Raj:)Now she's gonna know
I was snooping.

10
00:00:22,743 --> 00:00:24,073
(Bernadette:)What's happening?

11
00:00:24,078 --> 00:00:27,148
(Howard:)Raj was snooping through
Emily's drawers and broke one.

12
00:00:27,148 --> 00:00:28,478
(Raj:)Aw.

13
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:31,083
(Bernadette:)I'm gonna miss her.

14
00:00:32,385 --> 00:00:34,755
(Penny:)So what do you think?

15
00:00:34,755 --> 00:00:36,425
(sighs)

16
00:00:36,424 --> 00:00:40,124
(Leonard:)I thought it'd be
a little more... just more.

17
00:00:44,431 --> 00:00:47,131
(Penny:)I'm not even sure
why we were out of breath.

18
00:00:49,102 --> 00:00:52,072
Uh, I mean, d-did
we move at all?

19
00:00:52,073 --> 00:00:54,073
(Leonard:)Maybe along the z-axis,

20
00:00:54,075 --> 00:00:56,645
(Leonard:)but x and y are looking
pretty sad.

21
00:00:57,577 --> 00:00:58,907
(Penny:)Okay, come on.

22
00:00:58,913 --> 00:01:00,583
(Penny:)We are not old
boring people.

